.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH sway-things-night-light 1 "" "Sway Things 0.5.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-night\-light \- Switch the night light on or off, as the Brightness & Night Light page does: stores the switch and starts or ends its tool (wlsunset or gammastep)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things night\-light\fR [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISWITCH\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Switch the night light on or off, as the Brightness & Night Light page does: stores the switch and starts or ends its tool (wlsunset or gammastep)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fISWITCH\fR>
on, off or toggle
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
on: Switch it on
.IP \(bu 2
off: Switch it off
.IP \(bu 2
toggle: Switch it to the other state
.RE
